abstract: >
  NeuroInsight is a neuroimaging pipeline platform for processing, monitoring,
  and visualizing brain MRI data. It supports containerized pipelines
  (FreeSurfer, FastSurfer, fMRIPrep, QSIPrep, XCP-D, MELD Graph) with local
  Docker, remote servers via SSH, and HPC clusters via SLURM with
  Apptainer/Singularity. Data movement uses a dedicated Transfer page;
  Jobs submits compute-only pipeline runs on staged paths.
